# Raw Statistics Canada CSD boundary source (~150MB uncompressed shapefile) —
# too large to commit unlike every other scripts/vendor/ source (all under
# GitHub's 50MB per-file threshold). Fetch by hand per scripts/vendor/README.md;
# scripts/buildCanadaCitiesData.mjs's processed output (public/geo/) is what
# actually ships and IS committed.
scripts/vendor/canada/

# one-off build-script diagnostic output (e.g. scripts/buildEconomy.mjs's
